{
 "version": 1,
 "rule": "reader/coverage",
 "_doc": "A case is one chapter (paragraphs, matches per paragraph) or a book (chapters: [{paragraphs, matches}]). Offsets are code points. states: entryId -> familiarity of the type (the first candidate's entry). Token = a match whose surface holds a word character (zh: Han, 々, 〆; ja: also hiragana and katakana, not the lone ー). Unmatched = maximal runs of word characters outside every match. percent = floor(100 * known / tokens), null without tokens. Book = summed counts. unknown = types not known, count descending, then first occurrence (chapter, paragraph, start).",
